Version 1.2.0 (2026-10-01)
- bumped API version to 3
- list and sorted list: added onListClicked callback
- column list item: fixed error when refreshing columns while some of them are hidden
- cursorMovedThisFrame: fixed detection of whether cursor has moved when using controller
- fixed error that can sometimes occur when list is destroyed
- changed click behavior for lists:
  - triggers on release, not on press
  - does not trigger if released outside of list bounds
  - does not trigger if released over different item than pressed on
- added `lineHeight` and `listRowScale` to Theme.Sizes
- added setting to change `listRowScale` that will affect default line height in sorted lists
- Slider renderer: added roundToStep option
- progress bar: made value clamping optional

Version 1.1.0 (2026-09-25)
- bumped API version to 2
- added option to (set to Auto by default) to make UI look in style of Interface Reimagined
- controller: 
  - fixed wrong icon for default/PSX Right Shoulder
  - fixed rare case where controller hints can remain on screen indefinitely
  - added `setExternalHints` method to allow other mods to show controller hints
- interactive: added `onRClick` callback. Applies also to buttons and checkboxes
- item list/column list:
  - `onItemClicked` will be called only for left-click
  - added `onItemRClicked` that will be called on right-click
  - added `onItemClickedAny` that will be called when any mouse button is clicked on item, receives button in addition to item info
- added ProgressBar component

Version 1.0.1 (2026-09-20)
- tooltips: fixed thrown weapon damage not being doubled
- API: added `cursorMovedThisFrame` method to I.UIToolkit
- API: added new `getCenterPositionForSize` helper method to I.UIToolkit.WindowManager
- windows: improved detection of focused window
- windows: make sure window is not out of bounds on open
- readme: tweaked some tooltip descriptions

Version 1.0.0 (2026-09-19)
- initial release